msgid "Read only"
msgstr "Bloots leesbor"

#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_desktop.ui:31
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: rc.cpp:12 rc.cpp:90
msgid ""
"If read-only mode is enabled, no changes will be written to the file "
"selected above. Read-only mode will be automatically enabled if you do not "
"have write access to the file or the file is on a remote server that does "
"not support write access."
msgstr ""
"Is de Bloots-leesbor-Bedrief anmaakt, warrt keen Ännern na de baven utsöchte "
"Datei schreven. Hest Du keen Schriefverlöven för de Datei oder liggt se op "
"en Server, na den Du nich schrieven muttst, warrt de Bloots-leesbor-Bedrief "
"automaatsch anmaakt."

#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_desktop.ui:44
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_MonitorFile)
#: rc.cpp:15 rc.cpp:93
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "Beluern"

#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_desktop.ui:50
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#: rc.cpp:18 rc.cpp:96
msgid ""
"If file monitoring is enabled the resource will reload the file when changes "
"are made by other programs. It also tries to create a backup in case of "
"conflicts whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"Is Dateibeluern anmaakt, laadt de Ressource de Datei na Ännern dör anner "
"Programmen nieg. Wenn mööglich, warrt bi Konflikten ok en Sekerheitkopie "
"opstellt."

#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_desktop.ui:60
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_MonitorFile)
#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_mobile.ui:67
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_MonitorFile)
#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_desktop.ui:60
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_MonitorFile)
#: rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:60 rc.cpp:78 rc.cpp:99
msgid "Enable file &monitoring"
msgstr "Datei&beluern anmaken"

