#. i18n: file: singlefileresourceconfigwidget_desktop.ui:100
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: rc.cpp:33 rc.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Select the file whose contents should be represented by this resource. If "
"the file does not exist, it will be created. A URL of a remote file can also "
"be specified, but note that monitoring for file changes will not work in "
"this case."
msgstr ""
"De Datei utsöken, de ehr Inholt disse Ressource praatstellen schall. Gifft "
"dat de Datei nich, warrt se opstellt. Du kannst ok en URL vun en Datei op en "
"anner Reekner angeven, man denn funkscheneert dat beluern op Ännern nich."

